tos 32\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 33](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 33\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 34](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 34\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 35](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 35\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 36](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 36\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 37](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 37\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 38](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 38\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 39](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 39\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 40](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 40\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 41](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 41\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 42](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 42\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 43](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 43\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 44](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 44\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 45](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 45\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 46](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 46\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 47](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 47\")\n![Acme Avenue photos 48](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Acme Avenue photos 48\")\n\n## About [Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Kandivali West](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kandivali West\")\n\n## About Acme Group\n\n![](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/no-image-builder.svg)\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| About Acme Housing Projects, Realty, Builders & Developers in MumbaiTo turn the dream of thousands into reality, and bringing about true happiness, the Acme group came into existence.Established in 1976, today the Acme Group is one of the leading real estate companies in Mumbai, developing both residential & commercial projects.Over the last few decades, the landscape of Mumbai city has undergone rapid urbanization, at an unprecedented pace. So has the lifestyle of its people. In this scenario, the Acme group has taken a conscious step towards building homes, not just houses. The key to this has been in designing mindfully, while creating sufficient space for recreation and investing in Nature.In the last 40 years, Mumbai has witnessed almost a hundred Acme landmarks coming up across prime locations in the city. Presently, an added 7.5 million sq ft square feet of development is under various stages of construction, at different project sites. The sites range from residential, commercial and redevelopment projects in retail and IT parks.The Acme Group is driven by the pursuit of excellence which, for them, is a continuing journey and an enduring ambition. Every project is executed on the premise of perfection and is a witness to the Acme commitment of fulfilling the dreams of the customer, while adhering to the highest standards, as a construction firm.Over the years, the Acme Group has been associated with some of the biggest names in the industry, including HDFC, ICICI, Godrej, Piramal Capital, Tata Capital, Woods Bagot, Lewis & Hickey, Gardiner & Theobald, WAHO, Axis Bank, IDBI Bank and more.Yet, this is only the beginning. The foundation has been laid for fulfilling our promise of Housing Happiness, for everyone who dreams of their own home. |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![Ruparel Palacio photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Palacio photo\")\n![Pebble La Serena Tower 5 Tower 6 and Tower 7 photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pebble La Serena Tower 5 Tower 6 and Tower 7 photo\")\n![Rock Highland photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Rock Highland photo\")\n![Ashray Jaswanti Jewel photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ashray Jaswanti Jewel photo\")\n![Gagangiri Aadhya photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Gagangiri Aadhya photo\")\n![Shraddha Gold Crest photo](data:image/svg+xml;