t A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n2 ,3 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 743 sqft - 1056 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 195 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: 0.18 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2019\n* Rera: P51800002030\n\n## About\n\nHave a dream to stay in a high rise magnificent tower? Your wait is over as ACME group present a new under-construction residential project **ACME Avenue Wing A**. The luxurious project is located Babrekar Nagar, Charkop, Kandivali West, Mumbai. The area of Kandivali is considered as a prime one as far as the region of Navi Mumbai is concerned. Those who want to have an ultimate home in a limited budget, this is the best project to book a home with. RERA registered project helps one to be stress-free from the legal hassles. The international standard amenities provided under the project provide a comfortable living experience. With best of the class design this project is spread over 3.5 acres of land space consisting of 2 buildings having a total of 378 units offering 2 and 3 BHK apartments having floor plans from 491 sq ft to 995 sq ft area.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-poo