/static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/acme-avenue-project-floor-plans1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Acme Avenue Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/acme-avenue-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Acme Avenue Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-acme-avenue-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹1.56 Cr - 3.17 Cr**\n\n₹24,200 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Acme Avenue?\n\n## About Acme Avenue, Kandivali West by Acme Group\n\nThis project, Acme Avenue, is a luxurious residential property situated in the prime location of Kandivali West. The property is strategically located near major connecting roads, including New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, and Western Express Highway, making it easily accessible and offering a range of lifestyle amenities and opportunities. The project has received RERA approvals with registration numbers P51800002030, P51800004402, and P51800031398.\n\nAcme Avenue offers a range of world-class amenities, including a gymnasium, power backup, 24 x 7 security, sauna, and rainwater harvesting, among others. The project is designed to provide a luxurious and comfortable living experience, with amenities that cater to both the physical and mental well-being of its residents. The property also features specification including master bedroom walls with oil-bound distemper and flooring with laminated wooden, making it a perfect blend of style and functionality.\n\nFor those looking to invest in a luxurious property, Acme Avenue offers a range of unit options. From 2 BHK apartments with an area of 518 sq. ft. to 3 BHK apartments with an area of 1056 sq. ft., there s something for everyone. The prices of the units range from 1.56 Cr to 3.17 Cr, making it an attractive investment opportunity for those looking for a luxurious living.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Acme Avenue:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 518 | 1.56 Cr |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 743 | 2.23 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1056 | 3.17 Cr |\n\nThis residential property is situated in a prime location, surrounded by several significant landmarks that enhance the quality of life for its residents. These landmarks not only offer convenience but also provide opportunities for recreation, leisure, and business.\n\nWe have total 37 options available in Acme Avenue for resale and rental. In resale we have 26 properties available ranging from 2 BHK - 3 BHK having sizes from 1.33 CR - 2.10 CR\n\nFor rent you can check 11 properties having options for 1 BHK - 3 BHK with price ranging from 38000 - 55000.\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Listing Type | Total Listings | Unit Type Range | Price Range |\n| Resale | 26 | 2 BHK - 3 BHK | 1.33 CR - 2.10 CR |\n| Rental | 11 | 1 BHK - 3 BHK | 38000 - 55000 |\n\nAs per the recent government-registered transactions, the residential property market has witnessed a consistent trend in rental rates, standing at 48.006 over the past three, six, and twelve months, with the current rate pegged at 18,195. During the three-month aggregation, three sales transactions valued at 3 Cr were recorded. Over a six-month period, the number of sales transactions rose to seven, with a gross sales value of 10 Cr. Furthermore, the one-year aggregation saw a significant increase in sales transactions to 12, accompanied by a gross sales value of 17 Cr, indicating a thriving real estate market in the area.\n\n## Acme Avenue Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Acme Avenue.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  518 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.56 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  743 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.23 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1056 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.17 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nAcme Avenue's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Acme Avenue | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 24250 | 26800 |\n| Mar 2026 | 24000 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 23350 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 22800 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nAcme Avenue avg. price is ₹ 24.2 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 26.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Dosti Oro 67](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/dosti-oro-67/105339/project \"Dosti Oro 67\") | ₹ 34,450 |\n| [Paradigm Ananda Park](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-ananda-park/157970/project \"Paradigm Ananda Park\") | ₹ 33,650 |\n| [Paradigm Revive](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-revive/107077/project \"Paradigm Revive\") | ₹ 29,100 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 26,800 |\n| Current Project **Acme Avenue** | ₹ 24,250 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Acme Avenue ranges from ₹ 46.9 K to ₹ 65 K with options available for 2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Acme Avenue | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | ₹ 46.9 K | - |\n| 3 BHK | ₹ 65 K | - |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Acme Avenue.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 4 residential transactions has been registered so far for Acme Avenue, amounting to ₹ 7 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in Acme Avenue ranges from ₹ 30 K to ₹ 65 K with options available for 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Acme Avenue moved from ₹ 24,000/sqft to ₹ 24,250/sqft, reflecting a 1.04% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nStructural Works reach 100% completion. External Works has reached 64%. Internal finishing stands at 66%. MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 46% done\n\nA total of 190 out of 195 launched units have been booked as of April 2026, including 97% of 3 BHK AREA 1(56 out of 58), 96% of 2 BHK AREA 1(24 out of 25), 97% of 2 BHK AREA 5(28 out of 29), 97% of 2 BHK AREA 4(28 out of 29), 100% of 2 BHK AREA 3 (29 units), 2 BHK AREA 2 (25 units).\n\nA total of 147 out of 174 launched units have been booked as of April 2026, including 65% of 3 BHK AREA 1(34 out of 52), 73% of 2 BHK AREA 3(19 out of 26), 96% of 2 BHK AREA 2(25 out of 26), 95% of 2 BHK AREA 5(21 out of 22), 100% of 2 BHK AREA 1 (26 units), 2 BHK AREA 4 (22 units).\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n4 Sales Transactions Registered in Acme Avenue From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 19.3 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | ₹ 7 Cr | ₹ 19,300 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Acme Avenue Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 518 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Acme Avenue, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/acme-avenue-apartment-2-bhk-518sqft-20204603114642.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.56 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 743 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Acme Avenue, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/acme-avenue-apartment-2-bhk-743sqft-20204603114634.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.23 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1056 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Acme Avenue, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/acme-avenue-apartment-3-bhk-1056sqft-20204603114625.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 3.17 Cr\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Acme Avenue\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Acme Avenue, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Acme Avenue in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Acme Avenue in Babrekar Nagar, Mumbai]()\n\nBabrekar Nagar, Mumbai\n\n![Ravish kumar  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Acme Avenue in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Ankita A Kudtarkar  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Acme Avenue in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Ankita A Kudtarkar  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Acme Avenue in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Ankita A Kudtarkar  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Rent in Acme Avenue in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK + Extra Room Apar